# The build context was 5.8 GB without this file, and `data/` was 2.4 GB of it -- the
# whole index, the poster cache and the downloaded IMDb dumps, tarred up and handed to
# the daemon on every single build. Nothing in the Dockerfile ever reads it.

# The data volume. Mounted at runtime, never built in.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.tsv.gz

# The Dockerfile runs its own `bun install` per stage, and the host's tree is the wrong
# platform anyway once arm64 and amd64 are both being built.
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Fetched inside the web stage from the pinned Kometa commit. Excluding them keeps the
# image reproducible: what ships is what the pin says, never what happened to be on the
# machine that ran the build.
web/public/logos/

# Compiled spellfix1 -- built per-platform inside the spellfix stage.
vendor/sqlite-spellfix/*.dylib
vendor/sqlite-spellfix/*.so

# Secrets and local-only files. `.env` reaching a layer would bake credentials into an
# image that is pushed to a PUBLIC registry.
.env
.env.local
docker-compose.override.yml
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local tooling and history.
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/
.rclaude/
preview/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Docs and assets the runtime does not serve. `assets/brand/` is the source for the icon
# job, which is run by hand rather than at build time.
assets/
guides/
README.md
ADDONS.md
LICENSE
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.example.yml
